    <summary>Colourise &amp; restore black-and-white family photos locally with zero cloud fees.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[Bring old black-and-white family photos back to natural colour on your own PC — with batch album colourisation & gentle restoration, 5 colour looks, and zero cloud uploads.

Realistic Local AI Colourisation: Powered by the DDColor Large neural AI engine for natural skin tones and lifelike colours — with unlimited photos and zero per-photo fees. 100% Private for Family Archives: Your treasured family photos never leave your computer — no website uploads, no account sign-up, no adverts, and no tracking. Batch Colourise & Restore Whole Albums: Process entire folders of black-and-white photos in one go — either colourising them or running gentle restoration (clean-up, contrast, and sharpening) across the whole list. 5 Adjustable Colour Looks & Strength: Switch between Natural, Documentary, Historically restrained, Cinematic, and Warm nostalgia — and fine-tune the strength slider until your photo looks just right.

Licensing: AI ColourBack is commercial software and requires a paid license key (£14.99 one-time purchase for 1 PC at a time, personal & commercial use included, 1 year of free updates included — keeps working forever after 1 year with optional £7.99/year updates only if wanted, no auto-renewal, online activation and 14-day periodic licence check required; no free trial and no recurring subscription). Purchase at https://razorlinestudios.co.uk/app.php?slug=colourback.]]></description>
